<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14214" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφθείρω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φθερῶ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destroy utterly, ruin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				256
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέμας ἀσιτίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1106
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>have an abortion, miscarry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with fut.
			
				Med.
			, <i>to be lost, perish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				508
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be gone, make off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφθαρεὶς ἐκ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Sam.</u>
					282
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.3
			</span></i>: freq. in imprecations, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γῆς
				τῆσδ᾽ ἀποφθαρήσεται;</span> i.e. <i>let him begone with a
				plague</i> to him, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1290
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ εἰς κόρακας ἀποφθερεῖ;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					892
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				789
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφθείρου ταχύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Sam.</u>
					158
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφθάρηθι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					33.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
